#NEXUS

[ brusatte2008b_fig11: Area cladogram of five continents, slanted, root at the bottom. Numbers at nodes are bootstrap/Bremer support. 5 tips, fully resolved. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=5;
    TAXLABELS
        Asia
        Europe
        North_America
        South_America
        Africa
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE brusatte2008b_fig11 = [&R] (Asia,(Europe,(North_America,(South_America,Africa))));
END;
